{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIREBIRD \u2013 A Fairy-Tale Action-Adventure Platformer. Dark and Fun.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firebird</strong> is a fast-paced 2D action-adventure platformer set in a haunting fairy-tale world where myths fade and shadows come alive. Built in Unreal Engine 5, Firebird challenges players with tight traversal, creative puzzles, and stylish platforming-driven combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility and timing are everything. From wall jumps to monster vaults, every movement is a weapon\u2014and every level introduces a new mechanic to master. Whether you\u2019re dodging death traps or reshaping reality in dreamlike sub-levels, Firebird never stops evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/extras/7e3cabd0d8e9f8680251989c17f515c7.avif?t=1757943421\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Firebird Special:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming is the Core</strong> \u2013 Combat, exploration, and problem-solving are all driven by movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Full of Secrets</strong> \u2013 Explore three eerie biomes and surreal Dream Worlds where light and shadow shift the rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Outsmart mythical guardians using skillful traversal and smart mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals</strong> \u2013 Dark fantasy meets magical realism in gorgeous 2D levels powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Filler, All Killer</strong> \u2013 Fresh mechanics in every stage. Tight pacing. Zero grind.<br><br>Planned for PC <strong>Q4 2025</strong> and consoles in <strong>Q1 2026</strong>, Firebird blends the challenge of <i>Hollow Knight</i> with the magic of <i>Ori and the Blind Forest</i>, offering an unforgettable ride through a fading world\u2014and a second chance to reignite its flame.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/extras/0c4c3e59e52e4aa1aeb9c76f64a0ecfb.avif?t=1757943421\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812210?t=1757943421","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/c9d0a625bae69dfd5af9a37281e7c22a66f7d17e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757943421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/bae81d3d797ac6935365ce7c3a1a8a14a286ce2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757943421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/bae81d3d797ac6935365ce7c3a1a8a14a286ce2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757943421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIREBIRD \u2013 A Fairy-Tale Action-Adventure Platformer. Dark and Fun.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firebird</strong> is a fast-paced 2D action-adventure platformer set in a haunting fairy-tale world where myths fade and shadows come alive. Built in Unreal Engine 5, Firebird challenges players with tight traversal, creative puzzles, and stylish platforming-driven combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility and timing are everything. From wall jumps to monster vaults, every movement is a weapon\u2014and every level introduces a new mechanic to master. Whether you\u2019re dodging death traps or res